# Profile for the release-gate skill (~/.claude/skills/release-gate).
# Sourced as shell from the repo root; see that script's header for the contract.
#
# A LaTeX class has no package manifest, so the gate cannot detect where the
# version lives. Its primary source is the \ProvidesClass line in armymemo.cls;
# the first semver on that line is the version, since the date uses slashes.
# CHANGELOG.md and CLAUDE.md are the other two of the "three places" CLAUDE.md
# says to bump together, so the gate cross-checks them.
VERSION_CMD="grep -m1 ProvidesClass armymemo.cls"
VERSION_FILES="armymemo.cls:grep CHANGELOG.md:grep CLAUDE.md:grep"
